My Offers Admin – Privacy Policy
 My Offers User App, My Offers Shop App, My Offers Partner App and the My Offers Admin App/Web Panel (together, the "Services") Operated by : LITZ Tech Pvt. Ltd., Coimbatore, India. +91 9042090708
1. About My Offers Admin
My Offers Admin is a local offers and deals platform. Shops publish offers, discounts and hot deals; users discover and claim those offers, earn coins/points and rewards, and refer friends; partners promote the platform with a referral code and earn a share; and administrators manage categories, shops, users, reports, notifications, referral rewards and partner payouts.
This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, why we collect it, how we use and protect it, and the choices you have. By using the Services you agree to this Policy.
2. Information We Collect
2.1 Information you give us
•	Account details: name or user name, email address, phone number, password (handled by Firebase Authentication), profile photo and role (user, shop, partner or admin).
•	Shop details (shop owners): shop name, category, description, address, phone, email, website, social media links, shop images/logo and the offers, hot deals and product information you publish.
•	User preferences: selected interests, age category and offer categories you follow.
•	Partner details (partners): name, email, phone, referral code, wallet balance, share and payout history, and payment proof images uploaded by the admin when a payout is made.
•	Reports and feedback: reports you raise about an offer or shop (issue/reason, message), and reviews you submit.
•	Referral information: referral code you share or enter, and the name and phone number of the person who joined using your code.
2.2 Information collected automatically
•	Activity data: offers viewed, offers claimed (redemptions), scratch cards, coins/points earned or spent, and coin transaction history.
•	Location: if you grant permission, your device location is used to show offers from nearby shops and to apply the offer "boost radius" set by the admin. You can turn location permission off in your device settings.
•	Device and technical data: device type, operating system, app version, notification token, IP address, crash logs and security signals (for example Firebase App Check).
2.3 Information we do not collect
We do not collect payment card numbers, bank passwords or UPI PINs inside the Services. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.
3. How We Use Your Information
We use your information to:
•	create and manage your account and verify your identity;
•	show relevant offers by category, interest, age group and distance;
•	let shops publish offers and let users claim them;
•	calculate, credit and display coins, points, scratch cards and referral rewards;
•	calculate partner shares and record partner payouts;
•	send notifications about offers, rewards and account activity;
•	review and act on reports, prevent fraud and misuse, and keep the Services safe;
•	analyse usage (for example views and claims) to improve the Services;
•	comply with legal obligations and enforce our Terms and Conditions.
4. Referral and Reward Programme
When you join using a referral code, the referrer's ID and the referral status (for example credited or pending) are stored so that reward coins can be credited correctly. The administrator can see referral records, including the referrer, the referred person's name and phone number, the reward amount and the date. Reward amounts are configured by the administrator and may change from time to time.
5. How We Share Information
We do not sell your personal information. We share it only as follows:
•	Between users and shops: when you claim an offer, the shop may see your name, and your phone number where needed to complete the claim. Your offer details are visible to users, and shop details are visible to users.
•	With administrators: administrators can view user, shop and partner records, reports, referral data and payout history to operate and moderate the platform.
•	With service providers: we use Google Firebase (Authentication, Cloud Firestore, Cloud Storage, Cloud Functions, App Check and Cloud Messaging) to store data, authenticate users, store images and send notifications. These providers process data on our behalf under their own terms and privacy policies.
•	For legal reasons: if required by law, court order or to protect the rights, safety and property of users, shops, partners or the Services.
•	Business changes: if the Services are merged, acquired or transferred, your information may be transferred with notice to you.
6. Data Storage and Security
Your data is stored on Google Firebase servers. We use access controls, role-based permissions, Firebase Authentication and App Check, and encrypted connections (HTTPS) to protect your information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security. Please keep your login details confidential and tell us immediately if you suspect unauthorised access.
7. Data Retention
We keep your information while your account is active and as long as needed to provide the Services, resolve disputes, maintain financial and reward records, and meet legal requirements. When you delete your account, we delete or anonymise your personal information within a reasonable period, except records we must keep (for example payout and transaction history).
8. Your Rights and Choices
You may:
•	view and update your name, email, phone number and profile photo in the app;
•	ask us to correct inaccurate information;
•	ask us to delete your account and personal data;
•	withdraw location permission or turn off notifications in your device settings;
•	contact us with any privacy question or complaint.
9. Notifications
We may send push notifications about offers, rewards, referrals and account updates. You can disable them in your device settings. Admin is tractors may send announcements to all users or selected groups.
10. Children's Privacy
The Services are not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information. If you believe a child has given us personal information, contact us and we will delete it.
11. Third-Party Links
Shop profiles may link to external websites or social media pages. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those third parties.
12. Changes to This Policy
We may update this Policy from time to time. The updated version will be posted in the app with a new effective date. Continued use of the Services after changes means you accept the updated Policy.

